%% alt: Two apps and an agent call one AI gateway. It authenticates the caller, applies token quotas, runs policy hooks and routes the request. It retries or falls back between provider 1 and provider 2, and records usage per team.
flowchart TB
  A1[App A]:::human & A2[App B]:::human & A3[Agent]:::model --> AU
  subgraph G[AI gateway]
    AU[Authenticate]:::control --> Q[Token quotas]:::control --> P[Policy hooks]:::control --> R[Route]:::control --> F[Retry and fallback]:::control
  end
  F --> M1[Provider 1]:::model
  F --> M2[Provider 2]:::model
  R -.-> O[(Usage per team)]:::data
